 λ setup
 theme                       icons ● ◆ ○ ⎇ ▣ ±

  3/5  Claude
  ┃ Model
  ┃ model alias or id; leave empty to let Claude decide
  ┃ > bad model!

    Effort
      default     let Claude decide
      low         quickest answers
      medium      balanced
      high        more reasoning on hard steps
      xhigh       extended reasoning
      max         the most reasoning per step
      ultracode   long autonomous coding runs

    Status line
      auto   lyna status line unless you configured your own
      lyna   always the lyna status line
      off    no status line from lyna-tmux



   * must be a model alias or id such as opus or claude-opus-5 (got "bad
  model!")



 enter next  shift+tab back  ctrl+c cancel
